      "id": "sce-pitch-team-scale-ask-exit-c4",
      "heading": "The whole pitch in order",
      "explanation_md": "Put together, the very early stage pitch runs in this order:\n\n- Problem Statement\n- Solution\n- Market Size\n- Competitive Landscape\n- Customer Segment(s)\n- Insight\n- Uniqueness / Unfair Advantage\n- Business Unit Economics\n- Revenue Streams\n- Team Competency\n- Scalability\n- Requirement\n- EXIT\n\nA simple way to hold it: **problem and solution**, then **market and customers**, then **why you win**, then **how you make money**, then **who you are**, and finally **growth, the ask and the exit**.",
      "example_ids": [],
      "key_terms": [
